
Big Data Analytics & Predictive Intelligence
1. Project Overview

This project analyzes customer behavior and spending patterns using Python and machine learning.

The project focuses on customer spending, website visits, purchase frequency, and customer churn.

2. Objectives
Analyze customer behavior.
Calculate important business KPIs.
Identify spending patterns.
Analyze customer churn.
Visualize customer data.
Build a predictive machine-learning model.
Generate business insights and recommendations.
3. Dataset

The dataset contains customer-level information including:

Customer ID
Age
Gender
Purchase Frequency
Average Order Value
Website Visits
Previous Purchases
Total Spending
Churn status

Churn = 0 represents customers who stayed.

Churn = 1 represents customers who churned.

4. Data Preprocessing

The following preprocessing steps were performed:

Loaded the dataset using Pandas.
Checked for missing values.
Removed duplicate records.
Selected relevant features for analysis and prediction.
Saved the processed dataset.
5. Data Analysis

The project calculates:

Total customers
Average spending
Average order value
Average website visits
Customer churn rate
Average purchase frequency
Total revenue
6. Data Visualization

The project generates visualizations for:

Customer total spending
Website visits versus total spending
Customer churn distribution
7. Machine Learning

A Logistic Regression model is used to predict customer churn.

Selected features include:

Age
Purchase Frequency
Average Order Value
Website Visits
Previous Purchases
Total Spending

The dataset is divided into training and testing data before model training.

8. Model Output

The model generates:

model_results.csv

This file contains the actual and predicted churn values for the test data.

9. Dashboard KPIs

The project provides the following business KPIs:

Total Customers
Average Spending
Average Order Value
Average Website Visits
Customer Churn Rate
Average Purchase Frequency
Total Revenue
10. Architecture

The project workflow is:

Customer Dataset
       ↓
Data Preprocessing
       ↓
Data Analysis
       ↓
Data Visualization
       ↓
Machine Learning
       ↓
Churn Prediction
       ↓
Dashboard & Reports
11. Business Insights

The analysis can help identify customer spending patterns and customers associated with churn.

The predictive model can be used as a starting point for identifying customers who may require additional engagement.

12. Recommendations

Based on the analysis, businesses can:

Monitor customers with low purchase frequency.
Analyze customers with low website engagement.
Improve customer engagement strategies.
Track churn-related KPIs regularly.
Use predictive analytics to support customer-retention planning.
13. Technologies Used
Python
Pandas
NumPy
Matplotlib
Scikit-learn
Logistic Regression
CSV Dataset
14. Conclusion

This project demonstrates a complete data analytics and predictive-intelligence workflow, from data preprocessing and visualization to machine-learning-based customer churn prediction.
